    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# Login BOT Telegram\n## **Primul pas** \nIntrii pe [BotFather](https://t.me/BotFather), tastezi /newbot, completezi datele care le cere botul pentru a iti creea botul. \n## **Al doilea pas** \nIei Token-ul de logare de la bot (ex: 1234567890:QWERTYUIOASDFGHJKZXCVBNM)\n## **Al treilea pas** \nIn node-ul \"connect bot\", iar la sectiunea \"Credential to connect with\" apesi pe \"Create new credential\" si introduci Token-ul de logare al botului.",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 504,
        "color": 5
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -2304,
        96
      ],
      "id": "77934c00-1397-4866-9afe-c302c812a15d",
      "name": "Sticky Note"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# Apify (Search Maps)\n## **Primul Pas**\nIntrii pe [Apify - Google Maps Scraper](https://apify.com/compass/crawler-google-places) apesi pe \"Try for free\".\nIti faci cont pe Apify.\n## **Al doilea pas** \nMergi in partea dreapta sus si apesi pe \"API\", selectezi \"API Clients\", iar pe noul tab apesi pe \"Manage Tokens\".\nLa sectiunea \"Personal API tokens\" copiezi tokenul\n## **Al treilea pas**\nMergi pe Node-ul apiKEYs si pui API Key-ul la apiKEY_apify.",
        "height": 324,
        "width": 504,
        "color": 3
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -2304,
        432
      ],
      "id": "48a31bb4-32ac-47b2-a497-3b1cfaab3da0",
      "name": "Sticky Note1"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# Login Google Sheets\n\n## Primul pas\n\n1. Intri pe [Baza de date - Download](https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1WPNq8v1g8HOoFyFzOTzMnGTSYzNiSRsTk7NGdyA_5hg), mergi la File si selectezi \"Make a copy\".\n2. Te conectezi cu contul Google pe care ai incarcat baza de date.\n3. Deschizi fiecare node de tip Google Sheets din workflow (update1, update2) si selectezi:\n• Document: From List : {numeleBazeiDeDate}. \n• Sheet: From list: Foaie1.\n• Refresh Column List",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 504,
        "color": 4
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
